  name: 'wave1-callisto',
  description: 'Wave 1: W10 declaration tracking and W9b alias-conflict error (each implemented in its own worktree, then independently reviewed) plus a W9a resolver-divergence reproduction',
  phases: [
    { title: 'Implement', detail: 'one worktree per lane; tests first, scoped cargo only' },
